  "description": "Right after graduating high school, Yewon falls headfirst into an affair with the charming but married Han Ju-eon. She knows it’s wrong, but she doesn’t care. She’s in love.\n\n*“I want to hear you say it. Are you having an affair with that guy?”\n\n“Fine! We're having an affair. So what?”*\n\nThings start to spiral when their classmate Jeong Hwa-ik catches them in the act and makes her an offer of his own. Whether out of spite, curiosity, or something darker, she agrees.\n\n*\"Even if I sleep with someone else, you’re not going to leave your wife, are you?\"*\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
